      "spam": false,
      "value": "Had similar issue when I tried to overclock my CPU.\n\nI could hear people only for like first 90 seconds after starting VRChat, then everyone became silent and alot of messages like this started to appear in log:\n[Log:12/3/2017 1:23:39 AM] uSpeak [218]: <color=white>QueuePacket: discarding old timestamp packet 1036 at index 12, 6.03s old > max age 3.31</color>\n\nthe numbers seemed to be increasing over time:\n[Log:12/3/2017 1:27:09 AM] uSpeak [211]: <color=white>QueuePacket: discarding old timestamp packet 5414 at index 294, 15.593s old > max age 3.324</color>\n\nI suspect the time calculation inside uSpeak is somehow bugged.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
