  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Noticing after playing on a world for a while everyone will stop talking. Players will stop mid sentence and the indicator that shows when someone is talking will stop flashing. No audio is affected, and no indication that someone is muted. I've even tried to mute and unmute but that didn't fix it. Players told me they were talking the whole time to. Only way to fix this is to rejoin the world you're in.",
